        "original_id": "a52399b0-141a-504a-a73e-c8602dcc8886",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fulgencio Batista y Zaldívar, Osvaldo Farrés, Federico Laredo Brú\n- Songs: \"Quizás, Quizás, Quizás\"\n- Events: Cuban coup d'état\n\nFacts:\n- In 1940, Federico Laredo Brú finished his term as President of Cuba.\n- In 1952, Cuban President Fulgencio Batista y Zaldívar overthrew Federico Laredo Brú's constitutional successor in a coup.\n- Osvaldo Farrés composed the song \"Quizás, Quizás, Quizás.\"\n- Federico Laredo Brú served as inspiration for Osvaldo Farrés, the composer of \"Quizás, Quizás, Quizás.\"",
